d><td>—</td><td><span class=\"pill amber\">Fee set</span></td><td><span class=\"pill grey\">Pending</span></td><td><button class=\"del-btn\" type=\"button\" data-del-lead=\"33\" data-del-admin-only=\"1\" title=\"Delete this client, their consultation record and their OneDrive folder (careful — if there is a case, the case and its checklist go too)\"><svg/></button></td></tr><tr class=\"row\" data-id=\"34\"><td style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)\">Dev Test Four <span class=\"pill grey\" title=\"Converted from a Website lead — no consultation\">direct · Website</span></td><td style=\"color:var(--muted)\">PR</td><td>Consultant One</td><td><span class=\"pill grey\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"pill green\" title=\"Cash · recorded by Staff One (name as typed) on 2026-11-01\">Cash $200</span></td><td>$3000</td><td>2026-11-01</td><td>2026-11-02</td><td>2026-11-03</td><td><span class=\"pill green\">Paid</span></td><td><span class=\"pill green\">Open</span></td><td><button class=\"del-btn\" type=\"button\" data-del-lead=\"34\" title=\"Delete this client, their consultation record and their OneDrive folder (careful — if there is a case, the case and its checklist go too)\"><svg/></button></td></tr><tr class=\"row\" data-id=\"35\"><td style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)\">Eli Test Five</td><td style=\"color:var(--muted)\">Visitor visa</td><td>Consultant Two</td><td><span class=\"pill red\">Not Wanted</span></td><td><span class=\"pill grey\" title=\"Waived · recorded by Staff Two on 2026-10-30\">Waived</span></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td><span class=\"pill grey\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"pill grey\">—</span></td><td><button class=\"del-btn\" type=\"button\" data-del-lead=\"35\" title=\"Delete this client, their consultation record and their OneDrive folder (careful — if there is a case, the case and its checklist go too)\"><svg/></button></td></tr><tr class=\"row\" data-id=\"36\"><td style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)\">Fay Test Six</td><td style=\"color:var(--muted)\">Work permit</td><td>Consultant One</td><td><span class=\"pill green\">Retain</span></td><td><span class=\"pill green\" title=\"Invoice · recorded by Staff One on 2026-09-28\">Invoice $300</span></td><td>$2500</td><td>2026-10-01</td><td>2026-10-02</td><td>2026-10-03</td><td><span class=\"pill green\">Paid</span></td><td><a class=\"case-lnk\" href=\"/admin/case/2026-WP-004\" title=\"Open the case\">2026-WP-004</a></td><td></td></tr><tr class=\"row\" data-id=\"37\"><td style=\"font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)\">Gus Test Seven</td><td style=\"color:var(--muted)\">—</td><td>—</td><td><span class=\"pill green\">Retain</span></td><td><span class=\"pill green\" title=\"Paid in Square\">Paid in Square $300</span></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td><span class=\"pill amber\">Retain</span></td><td><span class=\"pill grey\">Pending</span></td><td><button class=\"del-btn\" type=\"button\" data-del-lead=\"37\" title=\"Delete this client, their consultation record and their OneDrive folder (careful — if there is a case, the case and its checklist go too)\"><svg/></button></td></tr>",
